LLAMA-3 PROMPT DEBUG
input_only: False
instruction: 'Write a descriptive paragraph about the taste of a fresh apple.'
target: 'The first thing that hits your senses when biting into a fresh apple is the crisp crunch, followed by a burst of flavour that is both sweet and tart. The juicy flesh of the apple is refreshing and provides a refreshing sensation in your mouth. The sweetness is subtle and not overpowering, offering a delicate sweetness that lingers on the tongue long after the apple has been consumed. The more you chew, the more the flavour intensifies, with a slight tangy sourness that makes your mouth water. The fresh apple has an incredible aroma that makes your taste buds tingle with anticipation as you savour every bite. The combination of textures and flavours makes eating a fresh apple a truly delightful experience.'
formatted_prompt: "<|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\nWrite a descriptive paragraph about the taste of a fresh apple.<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\nThe first thing that hits your senses when biting into a fresh apple is the crisp crunch, followed by a burst of flavour that is both sweet and tart. The juicy flesh of the apple is refreshing and provides a refreshing sensation in your mouth. The sweetness is subtle and not overpowering, offering a delicate sweetness that lingers on the tongue long after the apple has been consumed. The more you chew, the more the flavour intensifies, with a slight tangy sourness that makes your mouth water. The fresh apple has an incredible aroma that makes your taste buds tingle with anticipation as you savour every bite. The combination of textures and flavours makes eating a fresh apple a truly delightful experience.<|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\nThat sounds lovely! Can you give me more details about the different varieties of apples?<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\nCertainly! There are numerous varieties of apples, each with its unique flavour, aroma, texture, and colour. Here are a few examples:\n\n1. Red Delicious: This is one of the most popular varieties of apples that is recognized for its bright red skin and elongated shape. It has a sweet and juicy taste and a firm texture.\n\n2. Granny Smith: This apple is easily recognizable thanks to its green skin and tart flavour. It has a crisp texture and is often used in baking or eaten as a snack.\n\n3. Honeycrisp: This apple boasts a sweet and juicy flavour with a crisp texture. It has a red and green skin blend with white flesh.\n\n4. Gala: This variety is known for its sweet and gentle flavour with soft skin and crispy texture. It has a distinctive red and yellow skin.\n\n5. Fujis: This Japanese apple is a cross between the Red Delicious and Ralls Janet apples. It has a taste that's sweeter and less acidic than other apples, with a dense and crispy texture.\n\nThese are just a few examples of the many different types of apples available in the market. Each variety has its distinctive taste, texture and aroma, making them perfect for different types of recipes and occasions."
